# Cursor Project Rules

Before making changes, read and follow `AGENTS.md`.

Use `AGENTS.md` as the shared source of truth for AI builders, reviewers, and planners.

Review relevant docs under `/docs` before implementation work, especially:

- `docs/product/SITE_VISION.md`
- `docs/product/CONTENT_STRATEGY.md`
- `docs/product/INFORMATION_ARCHITECTURE.md`
- `docs/build/BUILD_WORKFLOW.md`
- `docs/build/DECISIONS.md`

Make small, reviewable changes. Preserve prior strategic intent. Ask before major product, architecture, or workflow changes.
